hub-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":292,"digest":"sha256:27e638cd1861f69a3909ffbb915a72566807ad0c7e79491c7efe0b554f7d6681","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-10-28T16:23:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T16:23:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/TechSavage1989/network-toolkit/releases/download/v1.17.109/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TechSavage1989/network-toolkit/tarball/v1.17.109","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TechSavage1989/network-toolkit/zipball/v1.17.109","body":"NETWORK TOOLKIT 1.17.109\n\nMORE ROOM FOR ACTIVE TOOLS AND DOCUMENTS\n\n- Remove the redundant global top bar. Computer identity and accessible theme,\n  settings and running-work controls remain available without another full toolbar.\n- Keep navigation accessible in expanded, collapsed and compact layouts while\n  allowing the active tool to use the reclaimed vertical space.\n- Replace the editor's permanent Move documents row with compact, explicit access\n  to its existing acknowledged move/merge controls.\n- Collapse the Local file and Connected session forms independently and remember\n  their presentation state in the main window. Detached choices last for that\n  window lifetime. Reclaimed space goes to editing and comparison.\n- Preserve unsaved documents, Undo, selection/scroll, safe file writes and native\n  window ownership; existing108 activity, bookmarks, graphs, vendor syntax and\n  security behavior remain unchanged.\n\nLayout evidence uses synthetic documents and actual hosted normal/narrow renders,\nwith direct height comparisons against the published108 UI. No private reference\nscreenshots or configuration contents are included in public source or packages.\n"}
